{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794528238973,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb3598ffevqcAV0JB0ZlAmZ","part":{"id":"prt_1d237dd7d001jUsDl5tToXHCxF","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb3598ffevqcAV0JB0ZlAmZ","messageID":"msg_1d237d654001kO6ZKQdv75Zyzy","type":"step-start","snapshot":"614239a6190839fe95251c21e49f475bc8ec3a01"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528241298,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb3598ffevqcAV0JB0ZlAmZ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d237de0b001OhpYWtFn9VgAju","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb3598ffevqcAV0JB0ZlAmZ","messageID":"msg_1d237d654001kO6ZKQdv75Zyzy","type":"tool","id":"call_825577678b174bfdb7f8550c","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml","oldString":"    - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\"\n    - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check.","newString":"    - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\"\n    - 'Run upstream_assets.codex_hook_approval with --root \"$PWD\". Covers the Codex approval that lets the project advisor hook run at all, since Codex skips an unapproved entry without a warning. PASS = in sync. WARN sets STATUS to WARN and shows the repair line it prints without counting as drift. SKIP leaves STATUS unchanged. Exit 0 = approved or no Codex hooks file, 1 = absent or unapproved, 2 = checker error.'\n    - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check."},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\n@@ -146,8 +146,9 @@\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_roster. Covers roster coverage across all five surfaces and rejects a real file where a symlink belongs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error (bad argument, canonical dir missing, or crash).\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_body_parity with --all. Compares each agent body across the runtime trees; same-file mirrors and non-comparable formats are reported, not counted as matches. Exit 0 = all comparable mirrors in sync, 1 = drift or comparison failure, 2 = checker invocation error (unknown option), 3 = not checkable (frontmatter parser unavailable).\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.command_catalog. Compare command frontmatter with the root and family indexes and hub metadata. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error.\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\"\n+    - 'Run upstream_assets.codex_hook_approval with --root \"$PWD\". Covers the Codex approval that lets the project advisor hook run at all, since Codex skips an unapproved entry without a warning. PASS = in sync. WARN sets STATUS to WARN and shows the repair line it prints without counting as drift. SKIP leaves STATUS unchanged. Exit 0 = approved or no Codex hooks file, 1 = absent or unapproved, 2 = checker error.'\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check. Covers the generated .pi/agents/*.md. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_prompts with --check. Covers the generated .pi/prompts/*.md stubs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/skills/ links. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_prompts, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/prompts/*.md files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"    - \\\"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\\\"\\n    - \\\"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check.\",\"newString\":\"    - \\\"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\\\"\\n    - 'Run upstream_assets.codex_hook_approval with --root \\\"$PWD\\\". Covers the Codex approval that lets the project advisor hook run at all, since Codex skips an unapproved entry without a warning. PASS = in sync. WARN sets STATUS to WARN and shows the repair line it prints without counting as drift. SKIP leaves STATUS unchanged. Exit 0 = approved or no Codex hooks file, 1 = absent or unapproved, 2 = checker error.'\\n    - \\\"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528239115,"end":1794528241298}}}}
