e/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml`.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/001-cli-hermes-creation/012-runtime-surface-parity-research/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl:\n  Line 1: {\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f58-no-single-gate\",\"iteration\":9,\"statement\":\"There is no single parity gate: four automated entry points (pre-commit agent-mirror block + 6 checkers; spec-kit-check.yml with the same 6 plus sync-gate1-pointers; agent-mirror-sync.yml; command-tree-parity.yml) plus one manual read-only route (/doctor runtime-mirrors). Seventeen other workflows guard quality, not runtime parity.\",\"evidence\":[\"shell ls .github/workflows/ (19 entries)\",\"file:.opencode/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit:87-104,147-155\",\"file:.github/workflows/spec-kit-check.yml:142-148\",\"file:.opencode/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml:3-7\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"}\n\n  Line 2: {\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f59-manual-route-is-strongest\",\"iteration\":9,\"statement\":\"The manual /doctor runtime-mirrors route covers strictly more than either automated gate: its upstream_assets include pi_agents and pi_prompts, which pre-commit and CI never run, and it carries a per-host hook-adapter fallback health table (file_exists per adapter behind every mkHookDrift chain) that detects degraded adapters rather than mirror shape.\",\"evidence\":[\"file:.opencode/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml:28-40,44-46\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"}\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/001-cli-hermes-creation/012-runtime-surface-parity-research/research/research.md:\n  Line 211: The diagnostic is stronger than the gate. `doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml` lists seven upstream assets, two of which no automated gate runs: `pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs` and `pi/sync-prompts-pi.cjs`. It also carries a per-host `hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks` table, one `file_exists` row per adapter behind an `mkHookDrift` fallback chain, which detects the degraded-adapter state rather than mirror structure. [`doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml:3-7,28-46`]\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/research.md:\n  Line 537: | `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml` | Add `.dsh/` mirror checks |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/001-deep-research/research/phase-plan.md:\n  Line 124: - **Creates or changes.** `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs`, `sync-prompts-dsh.cjs`, `sync-agents-dsh.cjs`, `README.md`. Tests under `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/` (`sync-skills-dsh.test.mjs`, `sync-prompts-dsh.test.mjs`, `sync-agents-dsh.test.mjs`). Generated `.dsh/skills/`, `.dsh/prompts/`, `.dsh/agents/`. `.github/workflows/command-tree-parity.yml` gains a `dsh-mirror` job. `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml` and `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-runtime-mirrors-contract.test.cjs` gain the `.dsh/` mirror. `.dsh/SYNC.md` is updated.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/005-dsh-mirror-generators/spec.md:\n  Line 114: | `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml` | Modify | Add the `.dsh/` mirror |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/005-dsh-mirror-generators/tasks.md:\n  Line 51: - [x] T009 Add the `.dsh/` mirror to the doctor (`